  "caveats": [
    "CpG panel coverage: 3 of 6 pre-registered Xu-2020 CpGs were present on the GSE51057 450K deposit (cg17301223, cg26203572, cg27091787). The mean-beta computation proceeded with 3 CpGs. The observed A-score distribution is narrow (range 1.11-1.19) because 3-CpG mean-beta sits near the top of the H(beta) curve; absolute values are not directly comparable to tier thresholds from full-class panels, but RELATIVE ranking (which drives Cohen's d) is preserved.",
    "GSE51057 is a retrospective case-control analysis; cases were identified after diagnosis in the EPIC-Italy cohort. Not prospective.",
    "Analysis does not adjust for batch effects, cell-type composition, BMI, smoking status, or menopausal status \u2014 all of which the published Kresovich/Xu analyses adjusted for. Our result is a lower-bound effect size relative to a properly covariate-adjusted pipeline.",
    "Xu-2020 CpG panel was selected on correlation with breast cancer outcome in Sister Study; using those CpGs to score GSE51057 may inflate Cohen's d relative to a naive CpG selection. This is a known pre-reg caveat and was specified before unblinding."
  ],
